      "GINA: The CLIP JOINT... D-LUX BEAUTY...The BEAUTY CALL? BOOTY SHOP?\nGINA: Dang. People get crazy with these names-—\nVALERIE: Mama?\nGINA: Hey, Baby. What're you doin' up?",
